# Python services (this monorepo)

## Layout

- `service-ingestion/`: FastAPI ingestion API and related tests.
- `service-worker/`: worker runtime and LangGraph (or similar) flow code.
- `shared/`: cross-service modules (for example telemetry helpers).

Prefer extending existing modules and test layout over new top-level packages unless the task requires it.

## Tests

- From the repository root, run the full Python suite with `python -m pytest -q`.
- For faster feedback, scope pytest to the relevant tree, for example `python -m pytest -q service-ingestion/tests` or `service-worker/tests` or `shared/tests`.

## Local development

- Full stack and ports are documented in [docs/local-dev.md](docs/local-dev.md) (Compose-first workflow, optional host hot reload, Jaeger, LLM profiles).
